### 10.31 典型处理流程

#### 10.31.1 Read Timeout后安全Retry

```text id="p9zj8z"
Read Attempt 1
      │
      ▼
Expected Return未按时到达
      │
      ▼
Timeout Detected
      │
      ▼
Policy允许Retry
