Attempt 1 Non-matchable
      │
      ▼
Authorize Attempt 2
      │
      ▼
Fresh GS Admission
      │
      ├── Fresh Expected
      └── Fresh Assembly
```

Timeout本身不会产生No-old-return Proof。

